<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS raised at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS raised at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss banking group UBS was raised to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a research note by analyst Ian McEwen said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>McEwen said the stock had underperformed by 20 percent in 1996 and was down ten percent since November. He said it now represented sound value at 11.4 times 1997 earnings and a yield of three percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
